# Pairs with TypeOK in WalMove. The durable fence is raised under an identity
# that is not one of the declared moves, so the fence's owner leaves its domain;
# only the well-typedness check reports it.
MODULE: WalMoveTypeOkFenceOwnerOutsideMoves
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the durable fence is raised under an identity outside the declared moves
PERTURBS: MoveFence

--- FIND
    /\ move' = [move EXCEPT ![m] = "fenced"]
    /\ dfence' = m
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a move is started under an identity outside the declared moves.
    /\ move' = [move EXCEPT ![m] = "fenced"]
    /\ dfence' = "unknown-move"
--- END